window.products.push({"id":395122,"name":"Kitchen Scissors, Samdone Ultra Sharp Premium Multifunction Heavy Duty Kitchen Shears for Chicken, Poultry, Fish, Meat, Vegetables, Herbs, and BBQ's (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618C0nEuKaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HEAVY DUTY KITCHEN SHEARS The best professional kitchen shears that deliver impeccable performance inside the kitchen as well as outside. A must-have product for any busy household, these kitchen shears are your go-to tool. WHY BUY OUR KITCHEN SHEARS? Stainless steel corrosion resistant blades – Will never rust and stay sharp for years. Micro-serrated blade edges – Designed to provide complete safety, non-slippery use. Easy-grip, slip-proof handles – Its handles are designed to provide comfortable, firm, non-slippery contact. It's time to make food preparation a lot easier! Go ahead, add to your cart and give it a try! ATTENTION: Keep out of children. Use carefully for sharp blade Clean and dry it after using. We're committed to providing 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION. If you have any question, feel free to contact us. Scroll Up & Click Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618C0nEuKaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samdone","source_asin":"B0731F3F82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0731F3F82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0731F3F82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395123,"name":"Ideal Home Range 3-Ply Paper Lunch Napkins, Soft Pink and White Big Stripes, 20-Count (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911pbPqM3yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The designers of Ideal Home Range see the beauty in paper and color and create collections to complement your life. Made in Germany using manufacturing processes. Look for coordinating plates and napkins in different sizes and colors. Entertaining has never been so easy! IHR is a vertically integrated company in that the designs are created and controlled in house, and then translated into spectacular paper napkins that are printed in their own state of the art printing facility next to their headquarters in Northern Germany. No competitors make this claim, and it’s a big part of what makes IHR’s napkins so extraordinary.Additionally an enormous amount of resources are constantly invested every year in trend research to ensure that the IHR line is fresh and on the leading edge of home fashion at all times. Furthermore the IHR range includes designs for all lifestyles and taste groups. In 1977, Ingrid and Hanjö Rick conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. The first headquarters of their company IHR was an old village school in Lower Saxony in the north of Germany. The young company grew steadily, becoming the trendsetter in its line of business and is today considered to be the international market leader in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories. Bring IHR to your table today and you'll be happy you did.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911pbPqM3yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B004W6X08W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004W6X08W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004W6X08W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
