window.products.push({"id":395175,"name":"AdHoc Cutty Wine and Champagne Bottle Foil Cutter - Wine Foil & Bottle Cutter - One-Button Wine Accessory - Hand Wash Kitchen Tool - 3\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BCeEcO2AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a glass of wine without worrying about the foil on top with the AdHoc Cutty Wine and Champagne Bottle Foil Cutter. This indispensable, time-saving wine or champagne tool uses compact and ergonomic design to cut away a bottle’s outer protective foil. The protective foil is essential to preserving a bottle’s natural cork, and removing it can be a potentially hazardous chore. This wine foil cutter quickly and safely removes foil caps without the need to use a knife or other sharp instrument. Simply place the foil cutter on the bottle top, hold the button to activate the blade, turn the cutter to cut the foil, and then remove the foil cap. With this foil cutter and wine accessory, you'll spend less time removing foil and more time enjoying the beverage. Product Details: Primary Material: Stainless steel Product Care: Wipe clean Since 1995, the AdHoc team has been developing, designing and producing according to our principle: \"\"design follows function.\"\" This principle follows the idea that more solid functionality leads to more beauty, more quality and more value. The innovative functions of each item are a true rarity. Whether you're an everyday cook or a kitchen professional, all tasks can become a thrilling experience with these elegant and simple kitchen accessories. All AdHoc products come with a two-year manufacturer guarantee. This warranty does not cover damage caused by accident, misuse, abuse, commercial use, or normal wear and tear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BCeEcO2AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AdHoc","source_asin":"B082F1VRN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082F1VRN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082F1VRN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
