window.products.push({"id":395221,"name":"Portable Blender, Personal size blender Smoothie Maker Blender, Personal Smoothie Mixer, Usb Rechargeable Smoothie Blender (WHITE)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L1m6PUAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Powerful Motor and 6 Blades] The portable blender is equipped with 6 durable asymmetric 304 stainless steel blades and blends on six different planes, creating a dynamic vortex for smooth, consistent results. The powerful motor inside enables the blades to spin at a blazingly fast 25,000 rpm. It takes less than 30 seconds to bring you a cup of fresh smoothie, protein shakes, fresh juices, baby food, etc. 【ULTRA SMART SAFETY PROTECTION】 adopts the most advance sensors technology for dual safety protection. With a magnetic sensing switch that won’t let the blades run if the bottle is not locked or appropriately attached. The blender embraces high-grade durable motor, safety indication LCD screen, silicone charging port protection, non-slip and shock large suction cup. Meanwhile, it made with BPA free, Eco-friendly and food-grade materials. Protect you safety while making perfect smoothie Multipurpose Use: This blender is great for making nutritious single-portion smoothies, juice blends, mix fruits and vegetables, coffee, milk powder, protein shake, cocktails, mocktails and baby supplementary food, leaving no chunks of fruit and ice. It can also be used as common bottle. Ideal for any kitchen, office or outdoor. Simple and Convenient One-Key Operation] One-button operation is very simple. After daily use, just add some water in and press the button to enter the \"self-cleaning\" mode. The juicer cup's body and bottom can be separated, you can easy to clean it. The base is water-resistant but please don’t soak it into the water for safety concerns. The blender is fast, has a long service life, and the juice is exquisite and does not leave large pieces of pulp. WHAT’S IN THE BOX: 1x Motor base, 1x cup and lid, 1xCharging data cable，1xJuice cup cleaning brush， 1x user manual. And we suggest you do not belend the ice cube too much time. This is bad for the blender motor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L1m6PUAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rzvnmko","source_asin":"B09F2W8S9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F2W8S9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F2W8S9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
