window.products.push({"id":395309,"name":"Digging Dolls: 1/8 lb of Beautiful Blue Sapphire Crystals Rough Stones from Brazil - Raw Rocks Perfect for Tumbling, Lapidary Polishing, Reiki, Crysta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lOa3KsosL._AC_SL1228_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and most spectacular stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.These beautiful blue Sapphire Crystals from Digging Dolls are imported directly from the mine owners in Tanzania. These crystals are the highest grade of Sapphire we currently have in stock. Our Dolls meet with the mine owners multiple times per year and scrutinize every shipment of Stones to ensure they meet the high standards required to be part of the Digging Dolls brand. These stones are versatile and can be used for many different purposes including tumbling, polishing, lapidary, crafts, art projects, reiki, fountains and so much more!Every stone is unique and you will not be receiving the exact stones in the pictures. As earth mined stones it is possible the stones may include possible minor flaws, imperfections, variance in colors, clarity, shapes, sizes, and patterns in every stone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lOa3KsosL._AC_SL1228_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B07Q573YHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q573YHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q573YHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395310,"name":"Isolator Fitness 3 Meal ISOBAG Meal Prep Management Insulated Lunch Bag Cooler with Stackable Meal Prep Containers, ISOBricks, and Strap - MADE IN USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SAEuc0PwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Fully insulated meal management system MADE IN THE USA! All bags are manufactured using YKK zippers! 2 Insulated Side Pockets keeping contents cold, 2 Mesh Side Pockets good for carrying tall bottles. Containers are BPA free/microwave/dishwasher/freezer safe/stackable and recyclable. 6 leak resistant container sizes included are: (3) 16oz, (1) 12oz, (1) 28oz, & (1) 38oz. 2 reusable ice packs keeping your food cold for up to 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SAEuc0PwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isolator Fitness","source_asin":"B00IASOECY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IASOECY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IASOECY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395311,"name":"MALOUF 600 Thread Count Egyptian Cotton Single Ply Bed Sheet Set-Split King-Slate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71agFQAhxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Authentic Egyptian Cotton This product is 100% authentic, single-ply, single-pick, long-staple Egyptian cotton. Yes, there was a lot we had to clarify there because there are several ways other brands try to deceive consumers. Egyptian cotton is superior to most other sheet material because of the long-staple. While the long-staple can be found in other cottons, it is most predominantly found in Egyptian grown cotton. This long-staple allows the cotton to be woven more extensively, creating a softer and more durable sheet that is resistant to pilling. The carefully crafted weave makes Egyptian cotton sheets more breathable. You can see why authentic Egyptian cotton sheets are so desirable; unfortunately, a lot of consumers are tricked into purchasing inferior products. Most Oversized Dimensions MALOUF manufactures their linens to the most oversized dimensions available. Fitted sheets accommodate mattress depths from 6 to 22 inches, perfect for thick mattresses or beds with mattress toppers. The ultra-thick fitted sheet elastic goes all the way around the mattress to guarantee a secure fit. Superb Workmanship MALOUF's Egyptian cotton is finely woven to produce a true 600 thread count, but thread count alone is not the best way to measure Egyptian cotton quality. Designed in the U.S., imported materials were used to provide the highest levels of quality and comfort. Available in white, ivory, khaki, chocolate, silver sage, and slate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71agFQAhxYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B00HVGGKM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HVGGKM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HVGGKM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395312,"name":"Oneida Corbett 114-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31kEkKd0NHL._AC_.jpg","description":"With over a 130 year heritage, Oneida has helped millions of people set their tables with style. Oneida spans generations of families, with today’s brides registering for Oneida flatware knowing it’s a brand they can trust. Each piece of Oneida is constructed using the finest quality materials, with craftsmanship and finishing that has been perfected for more than a century. All flatware is backed by a Limited Lifetime warranty. In quality gauge and finish, Oneida housewares flatware represents the best of the category. Fine flatware is no longer only a special occasion item in the home…you will see it grace the dining table for everyday use in many homes across the country. Styles range from formal to casual, but all offer the highest level of craftsmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31kEkKd0NHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oneida","source_asin":"B07FTQ3FF5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FTQ3FF5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FTQ3FF5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395313,"name":"Sweet Peonies - Canvas Wall Scroll Poster (24x16 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51snsyRTuzL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"[Manufacturing Process] This art canvas is not directly printed with reactive ink(easy to make, but easily be damaged by water and sun), it is dye sublimation product (better color, anti water and sun, hard to make for many manual operation steps), we used top quality printer consumables to keep fine quality. [Quality Control] We use our own equipment to make order item, we will re-make to resolve any quality problems until we think it is good enough, pictures were carefully selected, adjusted and edited, but each person's monitor has different color setting, the printing inks also have color deviation, if you are concerned about it must be 100% the same color as you saw in your monitor, please buy with caution, we promise that we will try to make product as best as we can, our old customers feedback could help you know how we did before. [Shipping Rate] This product will be shipped by USPS e-Packet in 1-2 business days from China. Normally 75% orders take about 7 to 14 business days, 24% orders will take 15 to 28 business days for Customs inspection, about 1% order may be delayed for uncontrolled reasons. In that case, please contact us to resolve this problem. [Unforeseen Circumstances] We will pack item very carefully, if it was damaged in transit (low probability but uncontrolled), you could contact us, we promise to re-ship for free in this case. [Customized Order] It can be customized according to your picture (picture size must be bigger than 1600 x 1200), please contact us and send us your picture, and please do send us your order id to help us know which order is your custom order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51snsyRTuzL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rock Bull","source_asin":"B010EB9BI6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010EB9BI6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010EB9BI6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
