window.products.push({"id":395413,"name":"Superio 6.5 Gallon Slim Step On Pedal Plastic Trash Can, Waste Bin for Under Desk, Office, Bedroom, Bathroom - 26 Qt, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514USnL8yJL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FOR TIGHT SPACES – Other than the practicality and functionality of this trash can, it is best to choose a step on trash can that is slim and compact with dimensions given by 11 x 8x 13.5 inches which can be a great fit for any space in your home. With its sleek and classic design, it is suitable for use as a bathroom trash can, kitchen trash can, or a small office trash can. INCLUDES BUCKET HANDLE – It is convenient that trash cans have bucket handles as this prevents the bag from slipping and crumpling which makes it easier to remove trash and replace your garbage bags. ZERO CHANCE OF RUST AND EASY TO CLEAN – Unlike stainless steel trash cans, this durable and high-quality plastic garbage can will never rust! Superio offers a trash can that allows you to get into nooks and crannies without breaking a sweat. Our foot pedal garbage can will definitely last you for years to come. NO MORE SMELLY TRASH CAN – Aside from the benefits listed, Superio trash cans make certain that these are high quality and really does what it needs to do – to store trash and help maintain a cleaner environment. With this said, it is perfect for dog waste trash can, bathroom trash can, and kitchen trash cans. COMES IN DIFFERENT COLORS – We have a color to suit every preference! No matter the decor style of your home, one of these trash can colors will be a great fit in your space. Shop our large catalogue of home and living essentials that will benefit you in designing your home aesthetics or spicing up your interiors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514USnL8yJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Superio","source_asin":"B07QB8NVZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QB8NVZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QB8NVZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395414,"name":"AK-Trading Chiffon Drapes Panels for Wedding Events & Decor- Backdrop Draping Curtains (115\" x 144\", Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411JWUxxf6L._AC_.jpg","description":"These gorgeous drape panels are made with a high quality Chiffon fabric. They are very commonly used to decorate wedding venues, tents, banquet halls, weddings, showers, corporate events and much more! Note that these drape panels are usually ‘gathered’ to create the look shown in the above image. IF USING FOR AN EVENT, YOU WILL LIKELY REQUIRE MULTIPLE DRAPE PANELS. DEPENDING ON THE LOOK YOU ARE GOING FOR, EACH 115\" WIDE DRAPE MAY COVER ANYWHERE FROM 2 TO 4 FEET WIDTH (DEPENDING ON HOW MUCH YOU GATHER EACH DRAPE). MAINTENANCE: These drape panels are machine washable, however, please be sure to test all items before washing. We cannot be responsible for any damage that occurs during any maintenance procedures. HIGH-QUALITY All our drapes are manufactured and shipped by AK TRADING CO. Our drape panels are proudly MANUFACTURED IN THE USA by highly skilled seamstresses. All cutting and sewing is done in our Los Angeles, CA facility. TURN AROUND TIME Our Drape Panels are usually manufactured on order, so please provide around 3 to 4 business days before they are shipped. This does not include your shipping transit time. CUSTOM REQUESTS? Always feel free to contact us with any custom or special requests. From large quantity requests to custom sizing, all inquires are welcome and we are always happy to assist. Please remember that all fabrics are subject to dye lot variations. Keep in mind that colors may not be exactly as displayed on your computer screen. Every computer monitor is configured differently and displays colors differently. The color shown in the image is a very close representation of what you will receive, BUT MAY NOT BE EXACT. Returns are not accepted on any of our fabric products, so please make sure slight color discrepancies are acceptable for your application. Please also note that dye lots may change from order to order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411JWUxxf6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AK TRADING CO.","source_asin":"B014ERJJKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014ERJJKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014ERJJKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
