window.products.push({"id":395486,"name":"Culina Oven to Stove 16” Roaster Pan Tri-ply Stainless Steel with Non-stick Roasting Rack and Bonus Carving Set.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yovGLglzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Culina Roasting Pan with Rack is a stylish and versatile addition to any contemporary kitchen. Constructed from 18/10 stainless steel, this durable kitchenware comes complete with a non-stick roasting rack and a two-piece stainless steel carving set, making it perfect for holiday meals and special occasions. It also makes a great gift. Use this versatile pan to prepare roasts and turkeys up to 25 lbs. The removable rack helps you achieve uniform browning and large handles make it easy to remove from the pan. A built-in drip reservoir collects all of those flavorful juices and drippings. Simply move the roaster to the stovetop (even induction) to make gravy in the same pan. When you are finished cooking, the pan is simple to clean by hand, and is also dishwasher-safe. The large handles on the Culina Roasting Pan are comprised of riveted stainless-steel and easy to grip for safely moving around the kitchen. Handles are aligned vertically to allow you maximum oven space. The curved edges on the pan allow you to safely pour hot liquids without making a mess. Constructed from sturdy 18/10 stainless steel, along with a tri-layer aluminum induction core for uniform heat distribution, the 16\" x 13\" roasting pan and rack both include large handles which make them easy to carry, even with oven mitts. The rack ensures efficient air circulation and an evenly-browned surface every time and the pan is safe to use at temperatures up to 475?. The Culina Roasting Pan, rack and bonus carving set are professional-quality, sleek and dependable kitchenware that, with the proper care, should last you a lifetime. We are confident that it will become your favorite roasting pan for holidays, special occasions and more, providing you with countless delicious meals. It makes a perfect gift item for that special someone and comes with the Culina 100% Satisfaction Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yovGLglzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B00ZDVUZR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZDVUZR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZDVUZR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
