window.products.push({"id":395666,"name":"Coffee Kitchen Rug Set 2 Pieces, Farmhouse Kitchen Sink Rugs and Mats Non Skid Washable Absorbent Microfiber Rustic Kitchen Floor Decor Carpet 17\" x 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ddI-pmEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant Design: Coffee-themed and rustic patterns fit most kitchen decor, with an elegant antique design that provides a warm atmosphere in the family kitchen. Perfect size: The kitchen rug set includes 2 mats (17x47 inches and 17x30 inches),L-shaped floor mat set is perfect for kitchen. Multifunctional: This kitchen floor mat is perfect for home kitchen floor, office, in front of sink, in front of stove, also suitable for doorway, bedroom, children's room, laundry room, dining room, porch, balcony, etc. Absorbent and non-slip: The kitchen mats are made of microfiber material that absorbs water and dries quickly, and the back side is made of high quality non-slip rubber that improves the friction and safety of the rug. Easy to clean: The kitchen carpet is machine washable, waterproof and easy to clean.They are water resistant rugs, when there are stains on the surface, it can be wiped with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ddI-pmEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dcohluk","source_asin":"B0B486Y536","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B486Y536","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B486Y536","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395667,"name":"VSUDO 2 Rolls 17.7\" by 78.7\" Window Film for Privacy, Iron Flower Pattern Window Tint for Home, Static Cling Window Glass Sticker (19.37 Sq. Ft Total)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fi6EprYhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Can we protecting our privacy and keeping the room still bright by natural sunlight? The answer is YES. Our decorative privacy window film can help you to make it happen. Highlight Features: -Protecting privacy and keep home or office bright -Decorate home to be more fashionable -No glue/no adhensive design, static clings to the glass firmly, far away harmful chemicals -Blocking 95% of UV ray away and filtering strong sunlight, prevent furniture from aging and fading -Reusable, ideal for rental places. No residue left on the glass, you can reposition it and reuse Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use our window films on windows of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding glass door window, glass cabinet panels. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Steps: 1. Cut films to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle, wet the glass with soapy water or clear water 4. Peel off the back protective film 5. Stick films on glass 6. Use the squeegee to remove the water and air bubbles 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Package Include: 2 Rolls Window Film: 17.7 inch By 78.7 inch (45 X 200CM) Tips: 1. This product is only suitable for smooth, flat and clean glass surface.Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors perfectly just when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fi6EprYhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B07JQ3X7B1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JQ3X7B1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JQ3X7B1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
