window.products.push({"id":395795,"name":"Teapot China Porcelain 12oz Dragon Stainless Steel Filtration Mash Infuser for Loose Tea (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l7mskU-QL._AC_SL1203_.jpg","description":"Capacity:350ml/12oz; wight:about 400g.Material:China porcelain dragon style The stainless steel mesh filter cover of the pot is separated. The mouth of the pot is large and the water outlet is large, so the inner and outer walls of the pot are easy to clean and keep healthy. SAFE FOR DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE - This porcelain are a type of premium LEAD-FREE and NON-TOXIC ceramic, chip-resistant and more sturdy than stoneware. Teapot infuser is made of quality high-fired ceramic. A comfortable handle and drip-less spout allow you to gently and easily pour the drinking. you can brew any tea from loose leaf oolong tea, coffee,herbal tea. teapot with a simple and convenient design. The lid opens wide, making it easy to fill tea in the infuser or pull out the filter for thorough cleaning. Our stoneware teapot can be washed in a dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l7mskU-QL._AC_SL1203_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YXHUPOT","source_asin":"B07WH3M2FD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WH3M2FD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WH3M2FD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
