window.products.push({"id":395797,"name":"The Bishop Cotton Full/Queen Size Duvet Cover, 800 Thread Count Soft 100% Egyptian Cotton Cool, Comfortable & Breathable, Home Decor 1 Piece True Luxu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nuBxrZ2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥ Welcome to the World of Luxurious Duvet in soft sateen and durable long-staple Cotton. We at The Bishop Cotton™ Believe in happy customers and best customer services Possible. Our 100% Egyptian Cotton 800 Thread Count Duvet Sets are the true definition of luxury and comfort. Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your Duvet? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns and turned into the softest Duvet you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply Duvet use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lightweight fabric with exceptional drape and softness. Make your bed more beautiful and comfortable than ever with the 1000 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton Luxury Sheet Set! You won't find luxury at this price anywhere else! We are excited to bring you luxury in the endeavor to make your overall health the best it can be. Our Egyptian Cotton has a feeling of relaxation, peace, luxury and comfort within its threads. Here's to peaceful, ultimate Sleep.Click on \"Add to Cart\" and enjoy the luxuriousness of The Bishop Cotton™ ♥","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nuBxrZ2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bishop Cotton","source_asin":"B0C5D6Q8V7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5D6Q8V7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5D6Q8V7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395798,"name":"ALP® Lockdown Shades, Blackout Shades for Classroom Windows and Doors in Traditional Fabric. Patented, Room Darkening Design Blocks Views. Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZBmoxOdnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don’t wait until it’s too late. Every second counts during a lockdown emergency. When an active shooter can see into your classroom, students and teachers become targets. ALP Shades are the only classroom blackout shades that feature a quick-release Velcro strap AND that secure at the bottom of the window, making them the best choice for every school. No other shade provides an immediate, secure and effective lockdown solution. Unlike many window blinds and blackout curtains, no tools, hardware, mounting brackets, or drilling is required. Our patented design utilizes strong adhesive tabs that hold the shade in place and provides the most effective method of dropping and securing the shade to the bottom of the window. Simply release the Velcro strap at the top so the shade drops over the window and press the bottom of the shade in place to completely block the intruder’s view. Our simple solution to classroom safety requires no extra time in the event of an emergency. ALP blackout shades are much safer options than blackout paper or blackout blinds for windows. ALP offers blackout shades in two unique fabrics to protect your classroom: Traditional blackout fabric--the standard in lockdown shade protection. Next Generation blackout fabric that can be cleaned easily. Features of our shades: Each shade completely blocks classroom views. Each shade releases the same way. Each utilizes the same patented design, attaching to the top and bottom of the window. Each deploys quickly to cover windows. Each is FR rated and meets appropriate NFPA standards. Each is available in standard and custom sizes. Both fabrics are available on Amazon ALP recognizes the importance of keeping schools safe. Every student. Every teacher. Every classroom. Every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZBmoxOdnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALP","source_asin":"B09PZCZ43J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PZCZ43J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PZCZ43J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":395799,"name":"Mozaic Futon Mattress, Full, Suede Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818VwnTzuEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unlike other futon mattresses, Trupedic offers a wide variety of colors that is fit for any room! Our durable polyester fabric comes in colors that will work for a child's room, guest area, craft room, and so much more! Trupedic's futon mattresses are next level comfort. Our fill material includes CertiPUR-US certified foam wrapped in cotton, which is naturally breathable to reduce heat absorption. The Trupedic futon mattress will fit most futon frames on the market. Pair your favorite color with your favorite futon frame, and you are set for a great nights sleep! Life happens, and you may need to clean up a mess here and there. No fear! Our durable polyester fabric is easy to clean. Just spot clean with cold water and mild detergent. The cover is not removable. [WARRANTY] - All Trupedic items come with a limited 90 day manufacturer's warranty. Hurry, don’t wait! Get the Trupedic experience NOW!\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818VwnTzuEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mozaic","source_asin":"B009TNRECQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009TNRECQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009TNRECQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
