window.products.push({"id":395973,"name":"Rajlinen Waterbed Sheets Set - 4 Piece Attached with Fitted Sheet Cool Breathable and Ultra Soft Rich 100% Cotton 15\" Deep Pocket Attached Waterbed Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ud1Lcrg-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENJOY THE COMFORT & SOFTNESS: Wrap Yourself with this Luxury Attached Waterbed Sheets Sets, Made of Pure Cotton- Sateen Woven at 600 Thread Count Creating Very Soft Bed Sheets. Choose the Color Your Desire from Our Available Lovely Selection of Solid and Stripe Colors. (Note: - Fitted Sheet And Flat Sheet Both Are Attached) SIZING & DIMENSIONS: Attached Waterbed 4-Piece King/California King Size Sheet Set Includes: ONE King Flat Sheet 80 inches wide x 96 inches long, ONE King Fitted Sheet 72 inches wide x 84 inches long and TWO King Pillowcases 20 inches wide x 40 inches long each. (Made to fit 72 X 84 inch King waterbed mattress up to 15\" Deep) DEEP POCKETS/ EASY FIT: They fit mattresses up to around 16 inches deep. If your mattress is smaller than 16 inches it will fit just fine. A lot of mattresses are pretty big these days and we feel this is a good universal size that fits most mattresses. LUXURIOUS COTTON SHEETS! Experience the divine feel of our Cotton Sateen Sheets! Our water bed sheets are made to be amazingly comfortable, irresistibly soft, and they are built to last a long time thanks to it being woven at 600 Thread Count per square-inch. These Sheets are made from 100% Cotton whose fibers are longer and the longer fibers lead to creating finer yarns. FEATURES: Attachment of Fitted and Flat Sheets at the Footer Makes Your Bed Always Made and Tidy. Also, This Waterbed Sheets Set is Soft and Durable. Care For : Machine wash in Cold Water , Do Not Bleach , Tumble Dry Low If Needed , Wash Dark Colors separately. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Our products are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If for any reason you don't love our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines. Our high-quality designs match any decor and make the ultimate gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest, kids room, vacation home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ud1Lcrg-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rajlinen","source_asin":"B078JSQ8P3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-395973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JSQ8P3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JSQ8P3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
